<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
<strong>Things don’t always go to plan</strong><br />
<br />
We’re committed to getting you to your destination on time. However, disruptions/schedule changes outside of our control can sometimes cause flight delays/ cancellations.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
I’d like to apologise on behalf of Qantas for the flight delay/cancellation and the impact on your plans. I understand and appreciate this is frustrating and stressful.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<strong>We're here to help</strong><br />
<br />
If you have travel insurance, your travel insurance provider may cover these sorts of situations. We would be happy to provide you with an insurance letter with the information you need to make a claim. If there’s anything else I can help with, please don’t hesitate to get in touch.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
&lt;If QFF FF &gt;In this instance, we have credited 5000 frequent flyer points to your frequent flyer account.<br />
<br />
&lt;If non QFF&gt; In this instance, we have included a AUD50.00 travel voucher.</p>
